\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Jesus, Sun and Shield art Thou,
\par Sun and Shield for ever.
\par Never canst Thou cease to shine,
\par Cease to guard  us, never.
\par Cheer our steps as on we go,
\par Come between us and the foe.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Jesus, Bread and Wine art Thou,
\par Wine and Bread for ever.
\par Never canst Thou cease to feed
\par Or refresh us, never.
\par Feed us still on bread divine,
\par Drink we still of heavenly wine.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3
\par \cf0\ulnone\b0 3. Jesus, Love and Life art Thou,
\par Life and Love for ever.
\par Ne'er to quicken shalt Thou cease,
\par Or to love us, never.
\par All of life and love we need
\par Is in Thee, in Thee indeed.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Jesus, Peace and Joy art Thou,
\par Joy and Peace for ever.
\par Joy that fades not, changes not,
\par Peace that leaves us never,
\par Joy and Peace we have in Thee.
\par Now and through eternity.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Jesus, Song and Strength art Thou,
\par Strength and Song for ever.
\par Strength that never can decay,
\par Song that ceaseth never.
\par Still to us this strength and song
\par Through eternal days prolong.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

